title: "Understory"
type: software
version: "0.2.2"
date-released: "2026-10-05"

authors:
  - family-names: "Harrelson"
    given-names: "Sam"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-8261-9316"

abstract: >-
  Understory is a warm, quiet Obsidian theme designed for long-form reading,
  research, field notes, and writing. It uses parchment and walnut-shell
  light and dark modes, bookish serif typography, restrained moss and autumn
  accents, quieter navigation and graph styling, and native research callouts.

